# Puppet Crafting as a spell with its target gone (CR 608.2b, 303.4f): Bot1 casts it on Mox Jet and Bot2 responds with Disenchant,
# destroying the Jet. The Aura spell has no legal target on resolution and doesn't resolve - it never enters the battlefield and is put
# into the graveyard - so Bot1 has no creature and the Aura is not attached to anything.

